                is a small site, by adding a geometric axiom schema to express J-continuity to the theory of flat diagrams, one obtains the
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/theory+of+flat+functors"} theory of J-continuous flat diagrams
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
